            "type": "text",
            "text": "About this pattern"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A hatching baby dinosaur worked as two pieces: a cracked egg shell and a small sphere head poking out of the top. This is a beginner-level make with just two straightforward pieces and very little assembly. The egg can be any pastel colour; the baby head is green. A short line of embroidered zigzag around the top of the egg represents the crack."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Egg"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Rounds: 21. Begin with a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " at the base and "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-increase"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "increase"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to the widest point, then "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "amigurumi-decrease"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "decrease"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " toward the top. Stop decreasing when about 10 stitches remain to leave an opening for the baby head. Stuff before the final rounds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: 6 sc in magic ring"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
