            "type": "text",
            "text": "Assembly"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sew the baby head into the egg opening, stitching around the neck join so the head is secure but appears to be emerging from the crack. The head should protrude about half-way above the egg rim."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Embroider a zigzag crack line around the upper portion of the egg in a slightly darker shade. Add tiny safety eyes to the baby face and embroider a small dot for the egg-tooth at the snout centre."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
